<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#assignedPerson> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Rob Brennan"@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#assignedPerson> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2020-09-29"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#assignedPerson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name of the person responsible for the action necessary to mitigate the risk. The Action Owner is responsible for reporting on progress relating to the achievement of the action assigned to them. The Action Owner should be one of the following, the Risk Owner, a member of the Risk Owner’s Management Team or the person to whom the Risk Owner reports."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#assignedPerson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "assigned person"@en .
