<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasRiskType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#RiskType> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasRiskType> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Lucy McKenna"@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasRiskType> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2021-03-10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasRiskType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a risk to the specific type of risk being assessed."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasRiskType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has risk type"@en .
