<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Culture> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A set of collective attitudes, values, goals and practices that characterize a community or system"@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Culture> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Culture"@en .
