<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Impact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The impact of a Risk. The powerful effect that something has on somebody/something. The outcome or consequence of an event affecting objectives. It can be expressed either qualitatively or quantitatively, being a loss, disadvantage or gain. There may be a range of possible outcomes associated with an event. Used for risk description following the ICC (impact, cause, context) approach."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Impact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Impact"@en .
