<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines a person, for example in an organisation."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Person"@en .
# 
# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#PlanPrepareStage
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#PlanPrepareStage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#PlanPrepareStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Stage> .
