<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#PlanPrepareStage> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2019-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#PlanPrepareStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Identifies the diverse activities required to achieve a desired goal and represent these in a plan. Prepares for the implementation of the plan."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#PlanPrepareStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Plan and Prepare Stage"@en .
# 
# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Post
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Post> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Post> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Lucy McKenna"@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Post> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2021-03-10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Post> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A position held by a Person within an organisation."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Post> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Post"@en .
