# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#PotentialLoss
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#PotentialLoss> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
