<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#PotentialLoss> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "CUBE Problem Stage. Loss is the fact of no longer having something or having less of it than before." .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#PotentialLoss> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Potential Loss"@en .
# 
# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Priority
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Priority> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Priority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKPlatform#DataEntity> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Priority> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Yalemisew"@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Priority> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2019-11-19"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Priority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The significance of an item (compared to all the Cube dimensions) in contributing to defining the context, identifying key mechanisms or describing critical outcomes, in a particular phase of an ARK Project."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Priority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Priority"@en .
# 
# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ProblemStage
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ProblemStage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ProblemStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Stage> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ProblemStage> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Yalemisew"@en .
