<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ProblemStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Describes the ‘as-is’ situation and identifies aspects which may not be working as well as they could be, leading to potential damage, harm or other unwanted outcomes. Describes the relevant dimensions of the problem space."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ProblemStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Problem Stage"@en .
