<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ProcessSequence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ProcessSequence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#SystemDimension> .
