<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ProcessSequence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Process/Sequence"@en .
# 
# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Project
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Project> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
