<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ProjectAnalysis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In the CUBE methodology this is an assessment of:\n    Risk (or Operational risk) in the problem stage.\n    (Potential) mitigation of risk in the solution stage.\n    (Potential) Risk in Change in the planning stage.\n    Risk in Implementation (actual risk in change) / Implementation risk in the implementation stage.\n    Residual risk (verified following implementation) in the verify stage."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ProjectAnalysis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Project analysis is a high-level ark project analysis used to identify values, loss, efficacy etc"@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ProjectAnalysis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Project Analysis"@en .
