<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Risk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risk is the effect of uncertainty on objectives. It is measured in terms of consequences and likelihood. In the context of the HSE and its services, it is any condition or circumstance which may impact on the achievement of objectives and/or have a significant impact on the day-to-day operations. This includes failing to maximise any opportunity that would help the HSE or service meet its objectives."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Risk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk"@en .
