<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#extremeImpactHSEBusinessContinuity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ExtremeImpactHSE> .
