<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#extremeImpactHSEBusinessContinuity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Permanent loss of core service or facility. Disruption to facility leading to significant ‘knock on’ effect."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#extremeImpactHSEBusinessContinuity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Extreme Impact - Business Continuity"@en .
# 
# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#extremeImpactHSECompliance
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#extremeImpactHSECompliance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#extremeImpactHSECompliance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ExtremeImpactHSE> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#extremeImpactHSECompliance> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Lucy McKenna"@en .
