<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#extremeImpactHSECompliance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Gross failure to meet external standards. Repeated failure to meet national norms and standards/regulations. Severely critical report with possible major reputational or financial implications."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#extremeImpactHSECompliance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Extreme Impact - Compliance"@en .
