# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hazardousSeverityAerLingus
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hazardousSeverityAerLingus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hazardousSeverityAerLingus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#SeverityAerLingus> .
