<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#majorImpactHSEEnvironment> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2021-08-25"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#majorImpactHSEEnvironment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Release affecting minimal off-site area requiring external assistance (fire brigade, radiation, protection service, etc.)"@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#majorImpactHSEEnvironment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Major Impact - Environment"@en .
