<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#majorImpactHSEHarmToAPerson> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2021-08-25"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#majorImpactHSEHarmToAPerson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Major injuries/long term incapacity or disability (loss of limb) requiring medical treatment and/or counselling. Impaired psychosocial functioning greater than six months."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#majorImpactHSEHarmToAPerson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Major Impact - Harm to a Person"@en .
