<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#serviceUserExperience> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risks which threaten the delivery of a service provision to  service users in terms of quality, in a  comfortable,  caring  and  safe  environment,  delivered  in  a  calm  and reassuring  way;  having  information  to  make  choices,  to  feel  confident  and  to  feel  in  control;  being  listened  to  and talked  to as an  equal;  being treated with honesty, respect and dignity."@en .
